cb45","layer":"original","quote":"中山太守张纯，叛入丘力居众中，自号“弥天安安王”，为三郡乌丸元帅","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":94,"end":126},{"id":"wuhuan-q-3e59aaf61d4fdc3d2731","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-228521c23fcc33c40b25","layer":"original","quote":"募胡斩纯首，北州乃定","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":15,"end":25},{"id":"wuhuan-q-dfd146083f78dabd0b4f","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-f55d6a89d37cd69fcb45","layer":"original","quote":"寇略青、徐、幽、冀四州，杀略吏民","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":127,"end":143},{"id":"xianzhu-e-p003a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-aaad2a9fe6d9aa146623","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《典略》曰：“平原刘子平，知备有武勇。时张纯反叛，青州被诏：遣从事将兵讨纯。过平原，子平荐备于从事，遂与相随。遇贼于野，备中创，佯死；贼去后，故人以车载之，得免。后以军功，为中山安（喜）〔熹〕尉。”","attribution":"《典略》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e4dddf546e62010fbc7d","start":0,"end":102},{"id":"xianzhu-q-p003","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-aaad2a9fe6d9aa146623","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《典略》曰：“平原刘子平，知备有武勇。时张纯反叛，青州被诏：遣从事将兵讨纯。过平原，子平荐备于从事，遂与相随。遇贼于野，备中创，佯死；贼去后，故人以车载之，得免。后以军功，为中山安（喜）〔熹〕尉。”","attribution":"《典略》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e4dddf546e62010fbc7d","start":0,"end":102}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
